{"id":"4896","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4896_main_cumulus-mediocris-homogenitus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图像显示了由距离摄影师2公里的煤炭发电厂的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">热羽流</span>产生的积云和层积云。</p>\n<p>由于风平静，烟羽垂直上升。凝结云的云底水平约为400米（使用150米的烟囱高度作为参考进行估算）。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>在低逆温层下扩散，而烟囱上方的热量已经穿透逆温层形成<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中积云</span>。云的人为性质意味着“人为性”分类也适用。</p>\n<p>在天空中较高的地方，也存在由飞机凝结尾迹扩散而形成的人为卷云；这是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">人为性毛卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰埃斯波","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"10 February 2010 1306 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.17","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.17"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/4896_syn_cumulus-mediocris-homogenitus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>寒冷的极地气团和高压脊覆盖着芬兰南部。平静的风和几乎晴朗的天空在对流层最低层产生了非常稳定的条件。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4896_upper_cumulus-mediocris-homogenitus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在图像拍摄1小时后，距离现场西北100公里处的探测显示出一个低于1500米高度的稳定对流层。最低的逆温层低于600米。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4822_main_cumulus-homogenitus_clouds-lithometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>是由于澳大利亚南澳大利亚Yorke半岛克林顿中心球场发生的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">两次人为火灾</span>导致的热量升高引起的。由于云是因人类活动的直接结果而形成的，因此它被归类为人为性积云。可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">烟羽</span>在火灾之上升起，在云底下<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">变得更加分散</span>。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Donald Hatch","location":"澳大利亚南澳大利亚克林顿中心","latitude":"纬度: 34° 14' 8'' S","longitude":"经度: 137° 55' 2'' E","date":"13 April 1999 1300 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.17","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.17"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4958_main_cumulus-mediocris-homogenitus_special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这张照片的主要特征是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">人为性中积云</span>的云线，这是由位于德国科隆以西的两座发电厂产生的。还有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云</span>，能见度因<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">霾</span>而降低。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Javier Martin-Vide","location":"德国科隆","latitude":"纬度: 50° 56' 11'' N","longitude":"经度: 6° 56' 22'' E","date":"28 August 2012 1835 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.17","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.17"}]}]}